<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian SFE January wheat contract trades lower.</title>
<headline>Australian SFE January wheat contract trades lower.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat traded lightly on the Sydney Futures Exchange on Friday, with four lots traded in the January contract in the only trades recorded.</p>
<p>January wheat lost A$2.50 to trade at A$172.00 a tonne.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for the untraded contracts were also mostly lower.</p>
